00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:30.810
scientists believe that all the
phenomena of the physical universe could

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:38.060
be understood as necessary consequences
of a small number of fundamental laws of

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:44.519
nature and by a law of a fundamental law
